# CPM Lead Intelligence OS — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Nothing here is required to run locally.

# --- Database ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Absolute or relative path to the SQLite file. Defaults to ./data/lead-os.db
# (created automatically, migrations applied on boot).
# DATABASE_PATH=./data/lead-os.db

# --- Sessions ---------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION (min 32 chars). In dev a secret is generated and
# persisted at ./data/.session-secret automatically.
# Generate one:  node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('hex'))"
# SESSION_SECRET=

# Set to 1 only if you accept a generated secret in production (not recommended).
# ALLOW_GENERATED_SECRET=

# --- Apollo.io enrichment (optional) ----------------------------------------
# Enables the "Fetch from Apollo" button on each lead's Intelligence tab.
# Lookups run only when clicked (1 credit each); personal emails/phones are
# never requested. Key from apollo.io → Settings → Integrations → API.
# APOLLO_API_KEY=

# --- AI (optional — the app is fully functional without it) -----------------
# With no key the deterministic rules engine handles everything and AI
# features show as "mock mode". Add a key to enable AI polish of drafts and
# richer reply analysis. The key is used server-side only.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
# Force mock mode even when a key is present:
# AI_MODE=mock
